flowchart TD
    A[AI response] --> B{Parses as requested structure?}
    B -->|No| C[Repair or reject]
    C -->|Resubmit| A
    B -->|Yes| D{Matches output contract?}
    D -->|No| E[Revise response or contract]
    E -->|Resubmit| A
    D -->|Yes| F{Content and edge cases are supported?}
    F -->|No| G[Request clarification or revise]
    G -->|Resubmit| A
    F -->|Yes| H[Accept for use]

